{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 22,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 551.454,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after I, Nephi, had read these things",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.406,
      "end": 7.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.326,
      "end": 10.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my brethren came unto me and said unto me:",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.2,
      "end": 13.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth these things which ye have read?",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.259,
      "end": 17.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, are they to be understood according to things which are spiritual,",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.129,
      "end": 22.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall come to pass according to the spirit and not the flesh?",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.803,
      "end": 25.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, said unto them:",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.212,
      "end": 29.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold they were manifest unto the prophet by the voice of the Spirit;",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.85,
      "end": 31.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for by the Spirit",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.655,
      "end": 34.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are all things made known unto the prophets,",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.482,
      "end": 38.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall come upon the children of men according to the flesh.",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.156,
      "end": 41.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the things of which I have read",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 41.751,
      "end": 45.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are things pertaining to things both temporal and spiritual;",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.646,
      "end": 52.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it appears that the house of Israel, sooner or later, will be scattered upon all the face of the earth,",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.024,
      "end": 54.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also among all nations.",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.654,
      "end": 58.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there are many who are already lost",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.131,
      "end": 62.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from the knowledge of those who are at Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 62.422,
      "end": 65.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, the more part of all the tribes have been led away;",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 65.667,
      "end": 69.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are scattered to and fro upon the isles of the sea;",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 69.191,
      "end": 71.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whither they are none of us knoweth,",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 72.018,
      "end": 74.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save that we know that they have been led away.",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.438,
      "end": 77.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And since they have been led away,",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 77.615,
      "end": 81.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these things have been prophesied concerning them,",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.185,
      "end": 89.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also concerning all those who shall hereafter be scattered and be confounded, because of the Holy One of Israel;",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 89.585,
      "end": 92.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for against him will they harden their hearts;",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 92.319,
      "end": 95.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they shall be scattered among all nations",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 95.982,
      "end": 97.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be hated of all men.",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 98.566,
      "end": 101.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, after they shall be nursed by the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 102.09,
      "end": 105.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord has lifted up his hand upon the Gentiles",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 105.521,
      "end": 107.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and set them up for a standard,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 108.023,
      "end": 111.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their children have been carried in their arms,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 111.454,
      "end": 114.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their daughters have been carried upon their shoulders,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 114.745,
      "end": 117.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold these things of which are spoken are temporal;",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 118.129,
      "end": 121.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus are the covenants of the Lord with our fathers;",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 122.117,
      "end": 124.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it meaneth us in the days to come,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 124.526,
      "end": 128.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also all our brethren who are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 128.735,
      "end": 133.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it meaneth that the time cometh that after all the house of Israel",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 133.513,
      "end": 135.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have been scattered and confounded,",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 135.969,
      "end": 142.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord God will raise up a mighty nation among the Gentiles, yea, even upon the face of this land;",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 142.372,
      "end": 144.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by them shall our seed be scattered.",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 145.653,
      "end": 148.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after our seed is scattered the Lord God will proceed",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 148.944,
      "end": 151.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to do a marvelous work among the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 151.771,
      "end": 154.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall be of great worth unto our seed;",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 155.016,
      "end": 156.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, it is likened",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 157.146,
      "end": 159.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto their being nourished by the Gentiles",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 159.88,
      "end": 162.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and being carried in their arms and upon their shoulders.",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 163.393,
      "end": 166.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall also be of worth unto the Gentiles;",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 166.963,
      "end": 169.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not only unto the Gentiles",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 169.326,
      "end": 176.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but unto all the house of Israel, unto the making known of the covenants of the Father of heaven unto Abraham, saying:",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 176.844,
      "end": 180.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In thy seed shall all the kindreds of the earth be blessed.",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 181.1,
      "end": 187.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I would, my brethren, that ye should know that all the kindreds of the earth cannot be blessed",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 187.271,
      "end": 191.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unless he shall make bare his arm in the eyes of the nations.",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 191.945,
      "end": 194.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Lord God will proceed",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 194.633,
      "end": 198.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to make bare his arm in the eyes of all the nations,",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 198.342,
      "end": 201.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in bringing about his covenants and his gospel",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 201.773,
      "end": 204.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto those who are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 205.054,
      "end": 208.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he will bring them again out of captivity,",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 208.485,
      "end": 213.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be gathered together to the lands of their inheritance;",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 213.541,
      "end": 217.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be brought out of obscurity and out of darkness;",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 217.761,
      "end": 221.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall know that the Lord is their Savior and their Redeemer,",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 221.517,
      "end": 223.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Mighty One of Israel.",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 223.915,
      "end": 227.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the blood of that great and abominable church,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 227.624,
      "end": 229.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the whore of all the earth,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 229.94,
      "end": 232.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall turn upon their own heads;",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 232.349,
      "end": 234.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall war among themselves,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 234.897,
      "end": 236.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the sword of their own hands",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 236.981,
      "end": 239.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall fall upon their own heads,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 239.437,
      "end": 242.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be drunken with their own blood.",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 242.718,
      "end": 245.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And every nation which shall war against thee,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 245.545,
      "end": 247.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O house of Israel,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 247.211,
      "end": 249.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be turned one against another,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 249.992,
      "end": 253.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall fall into the pit which they digged",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 253.701,
      "end": 256.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to ensnare the people of the Lord.",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 256.296,
      "end": 259.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all that fight against Zion shall be destroyed,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 259.309,
      "end": 260.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that great whore,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 260.929,
      "end": 263.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who hath perverted the right ways of the Lord,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 263.988,
      "end": 268.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, that great and abominable church, shall tumble to the dust",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 268.626,
      "end": 270.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great shall be the fall of it.",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 271.442,
      "end": 274.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, saith the prophet, the time cometh speedily",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 275.012,
      "end": 277.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Satan shall have no more power",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 277.746,
      "end": 280.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "over the hearts of the children of men;",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 280.527,
      "end": 282.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the day soon cometh",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 282.379,
      "end": 285.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all the proud and they who do wickedly",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 285.206,
      "end": 286.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be as stubble;",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 286.919,
      "end": 288.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the day cometh",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 288.724,
      "end": 290.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they must be burned.",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 291.076,
      "end": 292.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the time soon cometh",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 293.021,
      "end": 295.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the fulness of the wrath of God",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 295.616,
      "end": 298.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be poured out upon all the children of men;",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 298.954,
      "end": 303.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he will not suffer that the wicked shall destroy the righteous.",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 303.721,
      "end": 306.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he will preserve the righteous by his power,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 307.059,
      "end": 310.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even if it so be that the fulness of his wrath must come,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 310.676,
      "end": 315.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the righteous be preserved, even unto the destruction of their enemies by fire.",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 315.779,
      "end": 318.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the righteous need not fear;",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 318.42,
      "end": 320.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus saith the prophet,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 320.55,
      "end": 321.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be saved,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 322.123,
      "end": 324.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even if it so be as by fire.",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 324.753,
      "end": 327.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my brethren, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 327.209,
      "end": 329.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that these things must shortly come;",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 329.897,
      "end": 331.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even blood, and fire,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 332.074,
      "end": 334.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and vapor of smoke must come;",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 334.39,
      "end": 337.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it must needs be upon the face of this earth;",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 337.728,
      "end": 340.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it cometh unto men according to the flesh",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 340.509,
      "end": 345.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they will harden their hearts against the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 345.833,
      "end": 348.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the righteous shall not perish;",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 348.474,
      "end": 350.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the time surely must come",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 350.883,
      "end": 353.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all they who fight against Zion shall be cut off.",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 354.628,
      "end": 361.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord will surely prepare a way for his people, unto the fulfilling of the words of Moses,",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 361.217,
      "end": 362.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake, saying:",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 363.115,
      "end": 367.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A prophet shall the Lord your God raise up unto you, like unto me;",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 367.335,
      "end": 371.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "him shall ye hear in all things whatsoever he shall say unto you.",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 371.462,
      "end": 373.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 373.5,
      "end": 375.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all those who will not hear that prophet",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 376.095,
      "end": 378.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be cut off from among the people.",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 379.236,
      "end": 381.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, declare unto you",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 382.063,
      "end": 386.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that this prophet of whom Moses spake was the Holy One of Israel;",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 386.748,
      "end": 390.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he shall execute judgment in righteousness.",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 391.05,
      "end": 393.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the righteous need not fear,",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 393.598,
      "end": 396.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are those who shall not be confounded.",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 397.029,
      "end": 399.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it is the kingdom of the devil,",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 399.438,
      "end": 400.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall be built up",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 401.151,
      "end": 404.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "among the children of men, which kingdom is established",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 404.628,
      "end": 406.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "among them which are in the flesh\u2014",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 407.444,
      "end": 413.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the time speedily shall come that all churches which are built up to get gain,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 413.29,
      "end": 416.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all those who are built up to get power over the flesh,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 417.046,
      "end": 422.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who are built up to become popular in the eyes of the world,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 422.52,
      "end": 427.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who seek the lusts of the flesh and the things of the world,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 427.623,
      "end": 430.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to do all manner of iniquity;",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 430.264,
      "end": 434.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in fine, all those who belong to the kingdom of the devil",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 434.299,
      "end": 437.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are they who need fear, and tremble, and quake;",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 437.265,
      "end": 440.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are those who must be brought low in the dust;",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 440.696,
      "end": 443.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are those who must be consumed as stubble;",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 443.616,
      "end": 446.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this is according to the words of the prophet.",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 447.036,
      "end": 449.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the time cometh speedily",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 449.677,
      "end": 453.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the righteous must be led up as calves of the stall,",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 453.897,
      "end": 456.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy One of Israel must reign",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 456.492,
      "end": 458.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in dominion, and might,",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 458.344,
      "end": 460.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and power, and great glory.",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 461.021,
      "end": 466.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he gathereth his children from the four quarters of the earth;",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 466.449,
      "end": 468.492,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he numbereth his sheep,",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 468.672,
      "end": 469.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they know him;",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 470.013,
      "end": 472.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be one fold and one shepherd;",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 473.026,
      "end": 474.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall feed his sheep,",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 475.11,
      "end": 477.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in him they shall find pasture.",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 478.112,
      "end": 480.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because of the righteousness of his people,",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 480.986,
      "end": 482.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Satan has no power;",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 482.791,
      "end": 486.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he cannot be loosed for the space of many years;",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 486.733,
      "end": 489.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he hath no power over the hearts of the people,",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 490.164,
      "end": 492.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they dwell in righteousness,",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 492.712,
      "end": 495.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy One of Israel reigneth.",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 495.714,
      "end": 498.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I, Nephi, say unto you",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 498.588,
      "end": 501.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all these things must come according to the flesh.",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 502.287,
      "end": 506.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, behold, all nations, kindreds, tongues, and people",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 506.368,
      "end": 510.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall dwell safely in the Holy One of Israel",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 510.217,
      "end": 512.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they will repent.",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 513.312,
      "end": 515.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, make an end;",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 515.628,
      "end": 519.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I durst not speak further as yet concerning these things.",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 519.977,
      "end": 525.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my brethren, I would that ye should consider that the things which have been written",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 525.358,
      "end": 529.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon the plates of brass are true; and they testify",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 529.253,
      "end": 532.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that a man must be obedient to the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 533.277,
      "end": 537.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, ye need not suppose that I and my father are the only ones",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 538.101,
      "end": 540.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that have testified, and also taught them.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 540.789,
      "end": 544.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if ye shall be obedient to the commandments,",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 544.313,
      "end": 545.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and endure to the end,",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 546.072,
      "end": 548.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be saved at the last day.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 548.342,
      "end": 549.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus it is.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 549.962,
      "end": 550.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 170
    }
  ]
}